<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>413 Payload Too Large</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 2em;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f9f9f9;
      color: #333;
      text-align: center;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 10rem;
      margin: 0;
      color: #d33;
    }
    h2 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      margin-top: 0.5em;
      color: #666;
    }
    .explanation {
      margin-top: 2em;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
      color: #444;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>413</h1>
  <h2>Payload Too Large</h2>
  <div class="explanation">
    The file you're trying to upload exceeds the maximum allowed size.<br>
    Please reduce the file size and try again. Go back to the <a href="/">home page</a>.
  </div>
</body>
</html>
